// Missions V1-M01 through V1-M04, transcribed verbatim from the project's
// mission-lessons-m01.js / -m02.js / mission-lessons.js (M3) / -m04.js.
// Per Worldmaker_v2_Design_Decisions.md §8: once a lesson is written and shown to
// Nick, it is never regenerated. These four are already approved/ready-to-serve, so
// they live here as static, version-controlled source rather than being written by
// the planner. Missions V1-M05 onward are planner-generated and stored in D1
// (`missions` table, content_json column) the first time they are written, then
// served from there forever after — same "never regenerate" rule, different home.

